The pronunciation dictionary
----------------------------

The optional community dictionary is IBMTTSDictionaries by eigencrow,
https://github.com/eigencrow/IBMTTSDictionaries, released under CC0 1.0, a
public-domain dedication. The app downloads it from GitHub when the user
switches it on; it is not in this repository or in the apps.

